# Every tracked file checks out with the bytes it was committed with. Git on
# Windows otherwise rewrites LF to CRLF at checkout, and this repo compares
# committed bytes to produced bytes: the scaffold's licence text is compiled
# in with `include_str!` and asserted to hold no carriage return, and the
# authoring golden digest is over those same bytes.
* -text
